Below is a template code for a basic web application that logs user inputs and stores them locally in plaintext. This application uses HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for the frontend and Node.js for the backend.

### Frontend (HTML + CSS + JavaScript)
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>User Input Logger</title>
